# Quarkus (Vert.x, RESTEasy Reactive, Hibernate ORM with Panache): URL hot spots.
call   | http_server | GET /entity/fruits/{id}
event  | http_server | GET /entity/fruits | detail~status 200
call   | http_server | GET /repository/fruits
# SQL hot spots (through Agroal), done on worker threads for the requests and linked to the
# resource methods that ran them.
call   | jdbc | from FruitEntity
event  | jdbc | from FruitEntity | context~GET /entity/fruits
stack  | jdbc | from FruitEntity | FruitEntityResource
stack  | jdbc | from Fruit f1_0 | FruitRepositoryResource
call   | jpa  | find FruitEntity
control | jdbc | (pooled) | close
sample | cpu | [GET /entity/fruits/{id}]
